  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1686839165_2090336_945b103495ec35b57708bcc2f3df8288LIV21-ORIGINAL-LOGO-BLACK.png",
  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Website: www.JustLiv21.com</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">Instagram: @JustLiv21</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'book antiqua', palatino, serif; font-size: 10pt;\">LIV21 is a lifestyle brand that caters to young professionals and party-goers who live an active social lifestyle. Our flagship product is a one-of-a-kind solution for reducing hangover symptoms and aiding in post-party recovery. Our beverage can be enjoyed before, during, with, or after alcohol consumption to help you keep the party going without the next-day consequences.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'book antiqua', palatino, serif; font-size: 10pt;\">Our unique formula is designed to mitigate the negative effects of alcohol, providing a solution that allows you to enjoy a night out while minimizing the impact on your body. Our product is the perfect companion for busy individuals who value health and wellness but also want to have a good time.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'book antiqua', palatino, serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Product Description</span>:</strong> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'book antiqua', palatino, serif; font-size: 10pt;\">Discover the LIV21 Recovery Drink, the game-changing solution for dynamic young professionals who work hard and play harder. This innovative beverage aids in post-party recovery by reducing hangover symptoms and restoring normal body functions, whether consumed before, during, or after your night out. LIV21, a science-backed cocktail of Dihydromyricetin (DHM), electrolytes, B-12 vitamins, taurine, and milk thistle, goes to work immediately, replenishing your body and shielding your liver and brain from alcohol-induced damage. So here's to living life to the fullest with LIV21 - work hard, play hard, and recover easily.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 1rem; color: rgb(31, 33, 36); font-family: -apple-system, 'system-ui', 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space: normal;\" data-sanitized-data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span style=\"font-family: 'book antiqua', palatino, serif; font-size: 10pt;\">Ingredients: Water, Dihydromyricetin (DHM), Electrolytes (Sodium, Potassium, Magnesium, Calcium), Vitamin B-12, Taurine, Milk Thistle, Natural and Artificial Flavors, and Sweeteners.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;</p>",
